        "definitionKey": "ui-view"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-product-hero",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Hero",
      "position": { "x": -220, "y": 220 },
      "width": 640,
      "height": 260,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# The Graph Is The Product\n\nTwilite turns a node graph into a durable web artifact instead of trapping it inside a single tool.\n\nHumans and AI can both read it, write it, navigate it, and evolve it together."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-product-difference",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Why It Matters",
      "position": { "x": 500, "y": 220 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 280,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Why It Matters\n\nMost graph tools treat the graph as UI state or an internal implementation detail.\n\nTwilite treats the graph itself as the portable thing with value: linkable, saveable, inspectable, and editable on the web."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-product-how",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "How It Works",
      "position": { "x": 1080, "y": 220 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## How It Works\n\n1. Describe or author a graph.\n2. Save it as a durable artifact with an address.\n3. Let humans and AI navigate and revise the same structure.\n\nThat means a graph can move from thought, to collaboration, to execution without changing mediums."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-product-proof",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Proof",
      "position": { "x": 40, "y": 580 },
      "width": 620,
      "height": 300,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Proof, Not Just Pitch\n\nTwilite already runs in the browser.\n\nIt already persists graphs.\nIt already exposes them at addresses.\nIt already supports AI-assisted graph authoring.\n\nThis page is itself part of that system."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-product-get-started",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Get Started",
      "position": { "x": 760, "y": 600 },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 260,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Get Started\n\nUse this graph as the first pass for a public-facing Twilite product story.\n\nNext likely additions:\n- concrete use cases\n- screenshots or figures\n- a stronger CTA path\n- proof surfaces for live examples"
      }
    }
  ],
